  "title": "Aïoli",
  "description": "This garlic aïoli sauce is excellent with fish. Serve with grilled salmon, deep-fried cod, or baked bass; it is good with these recipes and so many more. Vary the flavor with olive oils from Greece, France, or Italy, but choose an extra-virgin olive oil. Do not store for more than a few hours.",
